  <main class="site-main">
    # Worksheets

One worksheet per lesson. Each worksheet can be printed directly from your browser using **Ctrl+P** (Windows) or **Cmd+P** (Mac). Select "Save as PDF" to download.

| # | Worksheet | Lesson |
|---|-----------|--------|
| 01 | [Worksheet 01](lesson-01/) | What is Arduino? |
| 02 | [Worksheet 02](lesson-02/) | Blink |
| 03 | [Worksheet 03](lesson-03/) | Multiple LEDs |
| 04 | [Worksheet 04](lesson-04/) | Button Input |
| 05 | [Worksheet 05](lesson-05/) | Buzzer and Sound |
| 06 | [Worksheet 06](lesson-06/) | Analog Input |
| 07 | [Worksheet 07](lesson-07/) | Sensors |
| 08 | [Worksheet 08](lesson-08/) | Mini Challenge |
| 09 | [Worksheet 09](lesson-09/) | DFPlayer Mini Setup |
| 10 | [Worksheet 10](lesson-10/) | MP3 Player Final Build |

